              "options": {
                "content": "### Day PnL view — auction window 13:20–13:40 UTC, avg over last 30 days\n\n**Window range baked into queries:** 2026-04-12 → 2026-05-11 (inclusive, UTC)\n\nFor each strategy, every panel:\n1. Filters to the daily 13:20–13:40 UTC window\n2. Computes per-day values (reset-immune: per session `last(pnl) − first(pnl)`, summed in the day)\n3. Means across the 30 days\n\n**Refresh:** these are hardcoded date windows. Re-run `regen_day_pnl.py` and re-import this dashboard whenever you want the window to roll forward.\n\n**Note on trading_pnl math:** trading_pnl here is computed as `avg(total_pnl) − avg(qty_open) × (avg(px_close) − avg(px_open))`, matching your original dashboard's transformation. This differs slightly from `mean(daily trading_pnl)` when qty/px co-vary across days. If you want strict per-day decomposition, ask for v2.",
